WEBVTT

01:32.005 --> 01:37.323
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.323 --> 01:40.382
[Episode 17]

01:42.439 --> 01:43.944
Help!

01:45.480 --> 01:46.480
Help!

02:03.400 --> 02:04.808
Help!

02:15.120 --> 02:16.199
No matter who hired you,

02:16.199 --> 02:18.000
I'm willing to pay double to save my life.

02:42.240 --> 02:44.080
Cang Lei, don't hurt her.

02:54.240 --> 02:55.240
My lady, you're frightened.

02:56.479 --> 02:57.608
Cang Lei.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.432
Get up.

03:04.560 --> 03:05.960
It's alright.

03:08.800 --> 03:10.400
Thank you.

03:10.400 --> 03:12.039
Thank you for saving me.

03:13.159 --> 03:14.344
Get up.

03:17.919 --> 03:19.176
It's alright.

03:29.719 --> 03:30.952
Thanks.

03:34.159 --> 03:36.120
I can't forget the favor of saving me.

03:36.120 --> 03:38.360
Please tell me your name.

03:38.360 --> 03:40.520
Tomorrow, I'll come to pay my respects

03:40.520 --> 03:41.759
and return this fine clothing.

03:43.800 --> 03:45.439
Our meeting in the mountains today

03:45.439 --> 03:46.680
is a stroke of fate.

03:47.520 --> 03:48.840
It's just a piece of clothing.

03:48.840 --> 03:50.520
Don't bother returning it.

03:50.520 --> 03:51.840
Saving you

03:51.840 --> 03:53.159
also accumulates good karma.

03:55.599 --> 03:56.680
On your journey,

03:56.680 --> 03:58.120
you've been escorted by soldiers.

03:58.120 --> 03:59.479
I can see your honor.

04:00.039 --> 04:02.120
I think you probably
don't care about rare treasures.

04:02.759 --> 04:04.439
The only thing I can offer

04:04.439 --> 04:05.680
is my talent in raising flowers.

04:06.639 --> 04:08.520
If you don't mind,

04:08.520 --> 04:10.719
I'd like to present you

04:10.719 --> 04:11.919
with some herbaceous peonies

04:11.919 --> 04:13.080
to brighten up your mansion.

04:13.599 --> 04:15.000
I've just arrived in Chang'an.

04:15.000 --> 04:16.599
I don't have a place to live now.

04:17.160 --> 04:18.519
We are both women.

04:18.519 --> 04:19.680
We should help each other.

04:19.680 --> 04:21.199
No need to be polite.

04:21.199 --> 04:22.639
If you keep this up,

04:22.639 --> 04:24.480
I won't be able to save any more lives.

05:06.560 --> 05:07.976
He Weifang.

05:11.040 --> 05:12.480
Mr. Jiang, why are you here?

05:13.120 --> 05:14.120
Why can't you change that sly look

05:14.120 --> 05:15.800
when you're back home?

05:16.439 --> 05:18.160
My aunt's judgment is too poor.

05:20.759 --> 05:22.639
What brings you here so late?

05:23.199 --> 05:24.712
I want to eat grilled fish.

05:28.319 --> 05:29.800
I'm not feeling well today.

05:29.800 --> 05:31.079
I'll do it another day.

05:31.079 --> 05:32.519
Goodbye. I won't see you out.

05:32.519 --> 05:33.704
Wait a moment.

05:37.199 --> 05:38.560
This outfit of yours

05:39.120 --> 05:40.839
doesn't look the same as before.

05:50.759 --> 05:52.360
What's going on?

05:52.360 --> 05:53.399
Nothing.

05:53.399 --> 05:54.920
I'm just…

05:54.920 --> 05:56.199
When I was climbing the mountain,

05:56.199 --> 05:57.279
I accidentally fell.

05:57.959 --> 06:01.600
The thorns scratched my hand. It's okay.

06:01.600 --> 06:02.952
I'm not a fool.

06:03.639 --> 06:05.519
Whether it's a knife
or grass that cut your hand,

06:05.519 --> 06:07.399
I can tell how much blood it would shed.

06:08.079 --> 06:09.560
You were acting suspiciously just now.

06:09.560 --> 06:11.639
You didn't want your two sisters
to see this blood-stained clothing, right?

06:11.639 --> 06:13.000
Lower your voice.

06:13.000 --> 06:14.480
If you don't come clean,

06:14.480 --> 06:16.319
I'll call them out right now to take a look.

06:16.319 --> 06:18.800
No. Please don't.

06:22.399 --> 06:23.639
That's how things are.

06:25.199 --> 06:26.720
But fortunately,

06:26.720 --> 06:27.759
I have great luck and fate.

06:30.040 --> 06:31.319
Do you know who did it?

06:35.600 --> 06:37.040
In Chang'an,

06:38.079 --> 06:39.639
I only have that one enemy.

06:41.519 --> 06:43.199
Not necessarily.

06:43.199 --> 06:44.879
Competition among merchants is common.

06:45.879 --> 06:47.040
While the flower guild has never done

06:47.040 --> 06:48.279
such ruthless tactics.

06:52.120 --> 06:53.519
Indeed.

06:53.519 --> 06:55.160
If it were just business competition,

06:56.160 --> 06:57.680
there would be no need to take my life.

07:00.839 --> 07:02.312
The real fear is

07:03.120 --> 07:04.600
that there's someone else behind this.

07:08.759 --> 07:10.319
I will have Chuanyu investigate it.

07:15.480 --> 07:16.600
Thank you.

07:16.600 --> 07:17.600
I didn't expect that

07:17.600 --> 07:19.360
Mr. Jiang would care a little for me,

07:19.959 --> 07:21.399
a small laborer.

07:23.279 --> 07:25.079
You're welcome.

07:25.079 --> 07:26.839
I can't stand someone
meddling with my money bag.

07:30.800 --> 07:32.040
Given that,

07:32.040 --> 07:33.639
can you just do the full good deed?

07:33.639 --> 07:36.120
Could you send someone
with great martial arts skills

07:36.120 --> 07:37.680
to accompany me
to Qingliang Mountain again tomorrow?

07:38.519 --> 07:39.752
For what?

07:40.439 --> 07:43.120
I want to retrieve the herbaceous peonies
I left by the stream.

07:45.839 --> 07:48.120
Others might forget the pain
once the wound heals,

07:48.120 --> 07:49.920
but your wound hasn't even healed yet.

07:49.920 --> 07:51.279
Can't you just calm down?

07:51.279 --> 07:52.399
No.

07:52.399 --> 07:53.639
Once those flowers are properly grown,

07:53.639 --> 07:55.920
a single one could fetch at least ten strings.

07:55.920 --> 07:57.160
It's really a waste to toss them.

07:58.079 --> 07:59.519
I've never met anyone as frugal as you.

08:00.199 --> 08:01.600
Your clothing is so tattered,

08:01.600 --> 08:02.639
but you don't throw it away

08:02.639 --> 08:04.000
and insist on bringing it back.

08:05.639 --> 08:07.680
This piece of clothing

08:07.680 --> 08:09.240
was bought for me by Shengyi

08:09.240 --> 08:10.680
after we earned our first sum of money.

08:10.680 --> 08:11.920
Naturally, I can't throw it away.

08:15.160 --> 08:16.240
Indeed.

08:16.240 --> 08:18.439
You are surrounded by fair-weather friends.

08:18.439 --> 08:19.720
You wouldn't grasp the deep friendship

08:19.720 --> 08:21.040
we have forged in tough times.

08:22.680 --> 08:24.639
It's late. Why isn't Mudan back?

08:25.319 --> 08:27.279
Let's go out to meet her.

08:27.279 --> 08:28.296
Okay.

08:35.480 --> 08:36.936
Let's go.

08:52.720 --> 08:53.919
They've gone.

08:53.919 --> 08:55.208
You can go back.

09:03.360 --> 09:04.720
Look.

09:04.720 --> 09:06.120
Why is there a cat?

09:12.240 --> 09:13.720
It seems to be injured.

09:15.080 --> 09:17.000
Its wound has already been dressed.

09:17.000 --> 09:18.759
You'd better be careful with your hand.

09:20.480 --> 09:22.559
How come it's bandaged the same way I am?

09:24.279 --> 09:25.399
Did you bandage it?

09:25.399 --> 09:26.879
Of course.

09:26.879 --> 09:27.879
I…

09:27.879 --> 09:29.159
I commanded Chuanyu to bandage it.

09:30.919 --> 09:32.168
Come here.

09:33.159 --> 09:34.480
It's not afraid of you.

09:35.279 --> 09:36.679
You seem very familiar with each other.

09:37.879 --> 09:39.399
Don't be fooled by its docility now.

09:39.399 --> 09:40.480
I

09:40.480 --> 09:42.639
have taken care of it for a whole year.

09:42.639 --> 09:44.080
Yet it still refuses to stay.

09:45.799 --> 09:47.759
It often appears and disappears unpredictably.

09:47.759 --> 09:48.960
Occasionally, it comes back wounded.

09:49.799 --> 09:52.240
But since it's there,

09:52.240 --> 09:54.000
there are no more rats in the house.

09:54.000 --> 09:55.399
It's got half a conscience.

09:58.000 --> 10:00.159
If it's caged and loses its freedom,

10:00.679 --> 10:02.240
no matter how many delicacies it has,

10:02.240 --> 10:03.399
they'll all taste bland.

10:04.360 --> 10:06.759
Outside, it might starve

10:06.759 --> 10:08.879
or face dangers.

10:08.879 --> 10:10.360
But the world is vast,

10:10.360 --> 10:11.519
with endless possibilities.

10:12.440 --> 10:14.039
It's indeed a clever

10:14.039 --> 10:15.600
and spirited kitten.

10:17.759 --> 10:19.679
You're quite sympathetic with it.

10:23.960 --> 10:24.960
It's so good!

10:29.120 --> 10:31.240
Little ears.

10:31.240 --> 10:33.600
Little belly.

10:33.600 --> 10:35.600
Little tail.

10:59.720 --> 11:01.000
I got my men to investigate

11:01.000 --> 11:03.600
the list of people who came in
and out of Chang'an when you were stabbed.

11:04.480 --> 11:06.600
This one is the most likely culprit.

11:15.960 --> 11:17.039
He comes from the Liu family.

11:18.000 --> 11:20.200
Indeed, this issue involves the Liu family.

11:21.120 --> 11:22.240
They know I'm alive.

11:22.240 --> 11:23.960
They also know my identity is fake.

11:24.519 --> 11:26.639
They operate in private
without notifying authorities.

11:27.919 --> 11:30.759
I'm sure they don't want to
let County Princess Ji'an know about this.

11:31.399 --> 11:33.000
Clever.

11:34.879 --> 11:36.600
Thank you very much.

11:36.600 --> 11:38.000
If I've been on guard against the wrong person

11:38.519 --> 11:39.960
and only narrowly escaped this time,

11:40.600 --> 11:42.559
I'll surely be done in by them in the future.

11:44.519 --> 11:45.679
How much is your

11:45.679 --> 11:46.799
sincere gratitude worth in gold?

11:47.440 --> 11:48.600
Shall we consider returning

11:48.600 --> 11:49.679
to our previous profit division?

11:49.679 --> 11:50.879
That is impossible.

11:56.480 --> 11:59.320
Do you want me to discipline them?

12:00.360 --> 12:01.399
You help me find out

12:01.399 --> 12:02.600
the puppeteer.

12:02.600 --> 12:03.840
I'm very grateful.

12:04.399 --> 12:05.879
How can I trouble you further?

12:07.960 --> 12:09.480
I've never forgotten

12:11.360 --> 12:12.519
to avenge my mother and Yulu.

12:16.120 --> 12:17.120
I will sooner or later

12:17.120 --> 12:18.159
meet them again.

12:21.080 --> 12:22.759
With a sly person like you watching,

12:23.559 --> 12:24.840
I will wait and see the day

12:24.840 --> 12:26.600
when the Liu family rises high and falls hard.

12:27.960 --> 12:29.639
We'll worry about the future when it arrives.

12:29.639 --> 12:30.799
How are you going to

12:30.799 --> 12:31.879
handle today?

12:32.440 --> 12:33.840
You can't be constantly on the lookout, right?

12:36.039 --> 12:38.159
Liu Chang knew I was in Chang'an beforehand.

12:38.759 --> 12:40.519
The Liu family did such brutal lengths,

12:41.519 --> 12:43.120
likely due to Liu Chang's feelings for me…

12:44.159 --> 12:45.840
You want to make him give up the feeling.

12:47.320 --> 12:48.720
I'm afraid it's not that easy.

12:52.080 --> 12:53.279
Now I have a false identity.

12:53.279 --> 12:54.279
I don't dare make too much of it.

12:54.840 --> 12:56.000
I can only dispel their

12:56.000 --> 12:57.440
thought of taking actions again.

12:58.480 --> 12:59.919
No matter how cruel

12:59.919 --> 13:01.279
his parents are,

13:01.279 --> 13:03.399
Liu Chang is at least a law-abiding man.

13:04.399 --> 13:05.679
Moreover,

13:05.679 --> 13:07.159
he has always been guilty about the matter

13:07.159 --> 13:08.320
of tribute medicine.

13:09.559 --> 13:10.799
Perhaps this guilt

13:12.000 --> 13:13.480
can help me resolve this matter.

13:21.120 --> 13:22.600
Don't let your lord come down.

13:23.440 --> 13:25.120
If seen by others,

13:25.120 --> 13:26.600
I'm afraid there will be
even more misunderstandings.

13:30.399 --> 13:32.360
I'm glad that you asked to meet with me.

13:34.279 --> 13:35.320
What's wrong with your hand?

13:37.000 --> 13:38.240
My hand

13:38.240 --> 13:40.399
was injured by the assassin
sent by your parents.

13:41.679 --> 13:42.824
Liu Chang,

13:43.600 --> 13:45.120
I nearly lost my life again.

13:47.120 --> 13:48.759
I'm sorry.

13:48.759 --> 13:51.080
I didn't expect that they would
find out you are still alive.

13:53.600 --> 13:55.600
I will immediately look for a safe mansion.

13:55.600 --> 13:56.759
You can stay by my side.

13:56.759 --> 13:58.080
I will definitely protect you.

13:58.080 --> 13:59.559
I won't let them hurt you again.

14:00.240 --> 14:01.512
Don't get off.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.360
The closer you are to me,

14:04.080 --> 14:05.399
the faster I will die.

14:06.960 --> 14:08.559
Liu Chang,

14:08.559 --> 14:11.039
do you really think you can defy your parents?

14:12.840 --> 14:14.440
As long as you and I still have ties,

14:15.360 --> 14:17.399
they will try every means to kill me.

14:18.720 --> 14:19.919
The protection you speak of

14:20.720 --> 14:22.559
is nothing but their knife to kill me.

14:23.440 --> 14:24.639
This is no different

14:24.639 --> 14:26.080
from you killing me yourself.

14:28.720 --> 14:29.960
Please tell your parents.

14:30.799 --> 14:33.080
I won't disturb your marriage
to County Princess.

14:33.720 --> 14:35.000
Nor will I hinder

14:35.000 --> 14:36.759
your glory and wealth.

14:38.000 --> 14:39.440
He Weifang is already dead.

14:40.320 --> 14:42.159
Please ask them to show mercy.

14:43.279 --> 14:44.320
And please you

14:46.240 --> 14:47.752
let me go.

15:07.519 --> 15:08.519
Father. Mother.

15:09.279 --> 15:10.919
Please let He Weifang go.

15:12.879 --> 15:14.759
We are educated and refined.

15:14.759 --> 15:17.480
Don't commit such acts
of killing and sin anymore.

15:18.000 --> 15:19.240
How do you know

15:19.240 --> 15:20.440
He Weifang isn't dead?

15:21.320 --> 15:22.360
Has she come to pester you?

15:23.159 --> 15:24.279
No.

15:24.279 --> 15:26.039
I discovered by chance that she is still alive.

15:26.720 --> 15:28.000
I was the one who looked for her.

15:29.440 --> 15:31.120
Why did you look for her?

15:31.919 --> 15:34.000
Do you intend to bring her back to Liu Mansion?

15:35.279 --> 15:37.399
Since you've agreed to
the marriage with County Princess.

15:38.120 --> 15:39.440
If County Princess and Prince Ning find out

15:39.440 --> 15:41.159
that your principal wife is still living,

15:41.159 --> 15:42.399
it's equivalent to defying Your Majesty.

15:42.399 --> 15:44.000
A capital punishment wouldn't be unwarranted.

15:45.600 --> 15:48.320
County Princess is infatuated with you
and wouldn't bear to kill you,

15:48.320 --> 15:49.679
but once the marriage falls through,

15:49.679 --> 15:51.919
your career won't be preserved.

15:53.440 --> 15:55.159
Zishu,

15:55.159 --> 15:57.360
back then, because of your affair
with County Princess,

15:57.360 --> 15:58.960
we were driven out of Chang'an

15:59.639 --> 16:01.960
and even forced to sell our ancestral home.

16:01.960 --> 16:03.720
Having barely managed to return here.

16:04.240 --> 16:05.679
Should those past issues arise again,

16:06.200 --> 16:07.799
your father and I

16:07.799 --> 16:09.000
might not be able to survive for long.

16:12.399 --> 16:14.159
I don't mean to betray the Liu family.

16:15.519 --> 16:17.039
I just implore you

16:17.759 --> 16:19.200
to ease her life.

16:21.240 --> 16:22.559
On the official records,

16:22.559 --> 16:24.519
she's already marked as deceased.

16:24.519 --> 16:26.639
She's no longer my wife.

16:26.639 --> 16:28.440
It is not us who want to kill her.

16:29.120 --> 16:30.480
It's you.

16:32.039 --> 16:34.200
If you can't resist seeing her,

16:34.200 --> 16:35.759
and then He Weifang is still alive.

16:35.759 --> 16:37.919
She will stand between you and County Princess.

16:39.159 --> 16:42.080
If you truly can treat her as if she were dead,

16:42.879 --> 16:43.919
naturally,

16:45.000 --> 16:46.799
we wouldn't need to make her die again.

17:01.039 --> 17:02.152
Alright.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.039
I promise you.

17:05.599 --> 17:06.720
I won't see her again.

17:08.559 --> 17:10.599
And then,

17:10.599 --> 17:11.839
both of you

17:13.079 --> 17:14.359
can be at ease.

17:18.000 --> 17:20.000
The Jia family has such strict rules.

17:20.000 --> 17:22.319
They insist on having incense powder
delivered right to their doorstep.

17:22.319 --> 17:23.920
It's incredibly fussy
and difficult to deal with.

17:24.880 --> 17:26.359
It's not a bad thing.

17:26.359 --> 17:27.640
The incense powder in this box

17:27.640 --> 17:28.960
has mostly been sold out.

17:28.960 --> 17:30.680
We've earned money, haven't we?

17:30.680 --> 17:32.119
That's true.

17:32.119 --> 17:33.720
Besides, going out for a walk

17:33.720 --> 17:35.960
is just like loosening up
our muscles and joints.

17:35.960 --> 17:37.599
Yes, you are right.

17:39.960 --> 17:42.039
Stop.

17:42.039 --> 17:44.480
- Don't run.
- Stop. Don't run.

17:45.000 --> 17:46.240
The doctor looks very familiar.

17:46.240 --> 17:47.319
Stop.

17:48.480 --> 17:49.880
He seems to be Lv Gengchun.

17:50.680 --> 17:51.799
Lv… Fu

17:51.799 --> 17:52.839
Hurry up.

17:57.599 --> 17:58.680
Don't run.

17:58.680 --> 17:59.799
Stop.

17:59.799 --> 18:01.160
Don't run.

18:01.160 --> 18:02.759
Stop.

18:02.759 --> 18:05.799
Who's that? Watch where you're going.

18:05.799 --> 18:06.960
What are you doing?

18:07.839 --> 18:09.759
I'm sorry.

18:09.759 --> 18:10.839
Stay back.

18:10.839 --> 18:13.200
I'm so sorry. Look at what I've done.

18:13.200 --> 18:15.559
- That person.
- I'm so sorry.

18:15.559 --> 18:16.640
Hurry up! Come with me.

18:16.640 --> 18:17.680
[Hanging a Gourd to Help the World]
What about that lady?

18:17.680 --> 18:18.720
She's very skilled.

18:18.720 --> 18:19.720
Let's wait for her at the store.

18:19.720 --> 18:20.920
- Hurry up. This way.
- My medicine.

18:21.480 --> 18:23.160
Hurry up. Forget it. Let's go.

18:36.000 --> 18:37.440
Lady Lv,

18:37.440 --> 18:39.200
why is it that every time I meet you,

18:39.200 --> 18:40.920
your behavior is so strange?

18:41.680 --> 18:44.232
Look.

18:47.559 --> 18:49.240
If she wants to harm you,

18:49.240 --> 18:50.599
she wouldn't help you today.

18:51.400 --> 18:52.880
If you don't trust us,

18:52.880 --> 18:54.728
and then you can go away.

18:56.400 --> 18:58.039
I'm just trying to save lives.

18:59.839 --> 19:02.000
When you previously bought flowers,
you only took the roots and stems.

19:02.640 --> 19:03.720
It was for use in medicine.

19:09.240 --> 19:11.119
I heard that Huamanzhu has

19:11.119 --> 19:13.160
a unique scent, Mengdiexiang.

19:13.160 --> 19:15.160
I just wanted to see
how its medicinal properties

19:15.160 --> 19:16.799
differ from those of other herbaceous peonies.

19:17.799 --> 19:20.240
Healing the sick is a noble act.

19:20.240 --> 19:21.319
Why act so furtively?

19:22.720 --> 19:24.839
A woman practicing medicine
often encounters prejudice.

19:24.839 --> 19:26.519
When some folks see that I'm a female,

19:26.519 --> 19:27.839
they immediately question my medical expertise.

19:28.559 --> 19:29.880
If patients are skeptical of me,

19:29.880 --> 19:31.680
how can they expect to get well?

19:33.160 --> 19:35.039
Why were those people chasing
and beating you today?

19:35.039 --> 19:36.720
Have you treated anyone poorly?

19:36.720 --> 19:37.920
No0

19:37.920 --> 19:39.880
Whenever I encounter an ailment
beyond my medical skills,

19:39.880 --> 19:41.640
I certainly dare not overestimate my abilities.

19:41.640 --> 19:43.119
But for all the conditions that I can treat,

19:43.119 --> 19:45.359
all of them are cured.

19:46.200 --> 19:47.440
Your medicinal herbs

19:47.440 --> 19:49.000
are worth far more than the fees you earn.

19:49.680 --> 19:51.279
You charge too little

19:51.279 --> 19:52.599
and break the trade rules.

19:52.599 --> 19:54.680
You must have been scolded
by other medical clinics.

19:56.759 --> 19:58.400
Hemorrhaging funds from patient visits.

19:59.640 --> 20:01.799
Are you the daughter of Guild Head Lv?

20:01.799 --> 20:03.640
My father is truly unaware of this.

20:03.640 --> 20:04.680
If I get caught

20:04.680 --> 20:06.240
and reported to my father,

20:06.240 --> 20:07.640
I'm afraid I won't be able to sneak out

20:07.640 --> 20:09.079
to practice medicine in secret anymore.

20:10.640 --> 20:12.319
If you feel unwell in the future,

20:12.319 --> 20:13.599
please seek me for treatment.

20:13.599 --> 20:14.839
I will surely not charge a penny

20:14.839 --> 20:16.039
as gratitude for today's kindness.

20:17.599 --> 20:19.519
You almost got caught being a female doctor.

20:20.079 --> 20:21.839
You're not worried about
losing your reputation,

20:22.359 --> 20:23.720
but about not being able to

20:23.720 --> 20:24.720
treat patients anymore.

20:26.079 --> 20:28.680
Some of my patients need regular injections,

20:28.680 --> 20:31.240
If the treatment stops
and their conditions relapse, what will happen?

20:32.799 --> 20:34.119
Oh. There's a patient

20:34.119 --> 20:35.839
who is waiting for me to deliver medicine.

20:35.839 --> 20:36.839
I must take my leave first.

20:41.519 --> 20:42.888
Wait a moment.

20:44.279 --> 20:45.319
What if you go out now

20:45.960 --> 20:47.440
and run into those people again?

20:50.000 --> 20:51.640
We'll deliver the medicine for you.

20:51.640 --> 20:52.920
You can change back
into women's clothing first.

20:54.720 --> 20:56.599
Only if you get through today safely,

20:56.599 --> 20:58.680
can you continue
practicing medicine in the future.

21:13.519 --> 21:16.279
What injured your hand?

21:16.279 --> 21:17.720
How long has it been like this?

21:18.519 --> 21:20.519
Seven days ago,
it was cut by a sharp instrument.

21:21.279 --> 21:23.079
It was no big deal after being bandaged.

21:23.079 --> 21:24.319
I understand a bit of pharmacology,

21:24.319 --> 21:25.519
so I prepared some

21:25.519 --> 21:26.799
medicines to dissipate stasis
and stop bleeding.

21:27.960 --> 21:29.759
It's just that sometimes

21:29.759 --> 21:31.200
I get a little shaky now and then.

21:34.720 --> 21:36.759
You try to make a fist.

21:37.640 --> 21:38.952
Make a fist?

21:45.640 --> 21:47.400
Now, you try to squeeze my hand.

21:52.920 --> 21:54.376
You can try harder.

22:03.559 --> 22:04.680
What's wrong?

22:04.680 --> 22:06.160
Is there something inappropriate?

22:20.160 --> 22:21.640
Does it hurt a lot?

22:24.880 --> 22:26.200
Quick, send someone to boil water,

22:26.200 --> 22:28.119
and bring some clean cloth and wooden boards.

22:32.440 --> 22:34.200
Fu has already sent the medicine.

22:37.039 --> 22:38.200
What are you doing?

22:39.319 --> 22:41.359
Don't panic. She's treating me.

22:42.319 --> 22:44.240
Your skin wound looks okay on the outside,

22:44.240 --> 22:45.960
but the injury to the finger tendons

22:45.960 --> 22:47.279
wasn't fixed right away,

22:47.279 --> 22:48.400
causing the trembling.

22:48.400 --> 22:49.720
If we don't cut open the injured area

22:49.720 --> 22:50.839
and put the tendons back in place,

22:50.839 --> 22:52.599
your hand might be useless forever.

22:54.920 --> 22:56.599
That's not it.

22:56.599 --> 22:58.319
It was almost healed.

22:58.319 --> 23:00.000
How could the tendons suddenly get damaged?

23:02.160 --> 23:03.599
Her words can't be trusted.

23:03.599 --> 23:05.200
She is the daughter of Lv Wanrong.

23:05.200 --> 23:06.359
Maybe.

23:06.359 --> 23:07.440
She just wants to take this opportunity

23:07.440 --> 23:08.839
to destroy your hand.

23:08.839 --> 23:10.799
No, I wouldn't harm anyone.

23:11.480 --> 23:13.359
Your hand has been delayed for a long time.

23:13.359 --> 23:14.400
It must be treated immediately.

23:14.400 --> 23:15.400
It can't be delayed any longer.

23:17.359 --> 23:19.079
Your father views me as a nuisance.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.279
Why do you want to help me?

23:24.559 --> 23:26.039
Because I'm a doctor first,

23:26.039 --> 23:27.240
and then I'm Lv Gengchun.

23:27.920 --> 23:30.119
I have heard of those rumors.

23:30.119 --> 23:31.839
But I believe in my father's character.

23:31.839 --> 23:32.960
Although he may be a bit rigid,

23:32.960 --> 23:34.279
he is an upright person.

23:34.279 --> 23:35.319
Those dirty tricks

23:35.319 --> 23:36.720
could never have been his.

23:37.640 --> 23:39.880
Of course, you'll defend your father.

23:40.680 --> 23:42.720
Mudan, you can't trust her.

23:44.039 --> 23:45.480
I don't understand business matters.

23:46.039 --> 23:47.799
I only know that top-notch healers

23:47.799 --> 23:49.359
help anyone in need,

23:49.359 --> 23:51.079
no matter if they're close or far.

23:51.759 --> 23:53.119
I've seen your hand's injured,

23:53.119 --> 23:54.279
so I must do something about it.

23:54.880 --> 23:56.279
If you don't trust my medical skills,

23:56.279 --> 23:57.880
you can send someone to find out

23:57.880 --> 23:59.680
if I've ever messed up treating any patient.

24:02.200 --> 24:04.079
I now know who you really are.

24:04.839 --> 24:06.240
If my hand deteriorates

24:06.920 --> 24:08.680
after your treatment,

24:08.680 --> 24:09.920
I'll have you arrested.

24:10.519 --> 24:12.519
You won't just get a beating.

24:13.160 --> 24:15.720
Your reputation
and your family's name will suffer.

24:17.119 --> 24:18.400
Even with that risk,

24:18.960 --> 24:20.440
are you still willing to treat me?

24:22.160 --> 24:23.640
If it's because of my ill intentions

24:23.640 --> 24:25.640
or poor skills that leave you disabled,

24:25.640 --> 24:27.240
getting a beating is nothing.

24:27.240 --> 24:28.680
I should be the one to have my hand disabled.

24:45.599 --> 24:47.279
This is the handkerchief

24:47.279 --> 24:48.400
you left when we first met.

24:49.799 --> 24:51.240
Even the Gentian

24:51.240 --> 24:53.000
embroidered on it is medicinal.

24:54.160 --> 24:56.440
It's clear you're truly obsessed
with medical skills and pharmacology.

24:58.599 --> 24:59.944
I believe you.

24:59.944 --> 25:00.960
Mudan.

25:06.880 --> 25:08.680
I trust what I feel and what I see

25:08.680 --> 25:10.839
more than whose daughter she is.

25:16.079 --> 25:17.416
Chun.

25:18.000 --> 25:19.440
Just call me Chun.

25:20.640 --> 25:22.319
I will surely help you recover.

25:22.319 --> 25:23.880
I will never betray your trust.

25:24.559 --> 25:25.920
Alright.

25:25.920 --> 25:28.279
Then I entrust my hands to you.

25:28.880 --> 25:30.160
Doctor Chun.

25:40.400 --> 25:42.359
Where did you find such a charlatan?

25:42.359 --> 25:44.279
Why are your hands wrapped up like a fan?

25:45.079 --> 25:47.480
You have taken too much interest.

25:47.480 --> 25:48.599
I can only afford

25:48.599 --> 25:49.599
to hire a charlatan.

25:50.319 --> 25:51.759
This statement is inappropriate.

25:51.759 --> 25:54.119
Our share was agreed upon long ago.

25:54.119 --> 25:56.000
Might you renege on your promise?

25:56.000 --> 25:57.799
What I've promised,

25:57.799 --> 25:59.720
I'll never go back on.

25:59.720 --> 26:00.759
On the contrary,

26:00.759 --> 26:02.440
I want to send money to you.

26:03.759 --> 26:05.240
What are you scheming now?

26:06.200 --> 26:09.160
My hands are like this.
What scheme could I have?

26:09.160 --> 26:10.200
Mr. Jiang,

26:10.200 --> 26:11.720
could you please not judge

26:11.720 --> 26:13.559
a gentleman's heart with a petty mind?

26:13.559 --> 26:15.079
What I'm talking about is

26:15.079 --> 26:17.400
Qiongtai Yulu that is pawned at your mansion.

26:17.400 --> 26:18.640
It's time to redeem it back.

26:19.839 --> 26:21.119
That's easy to say.

26:21.119 --> 26:22.559
Let's see how tonight's

26:22.559 --> 26:23.680
supper tastes.

26:24.359 --> 26:25.440
Someone has just brought me

26:25.440 --> 26:27.039
the finest meat.

26:27.039 --> 26:29.359
The barbecue is too smoky.

26:29.359 --> 26:30.519
I'm afraid it'll stain my mansion.

26:31.279 --> 26:32.880
It's still your little shitty yard
that's suitable for it.

26:32.880 --> 26:34.152
Mr. Jiang,

26:34.680 --> 26:36.160
my hands are like this.

26:36.160 --> 26:38.039
I can't serve you food and drink.

26:38.039 --> 26:39.160
During the healing period,

26:39.160 --> 26:41.119
you might as well seek pleasure elsewhere.

26:42.640 --> 26:43.720
Your right hand is inconvenient,

26:44.519 --> 26:45.920
but the left one can be used, right?

26:46.480 --> 26:48.680
Or you don't want to

26:48.680 --> 26:49.960
redeem that flower anymore?

26:52.359 --> 26:53.440
During the day, I specially had someone

26:53.440 --> 26:54.880
send over a swing.

26:54.880 --> 26:56.440
It's also to add some charm

26:56.440 --> 26:57.480
to your courtyard.

27:03.359 --> 27:05.480
I truly thank you.

27:11.680 --> 27:14.240
You know I can't eat certain things
and have to eat sesame cakes.

27:15.920 --> 27:17.519
You're not only going to

27:17.519 --> 27:19.079
eat meat in front of me later,

27:19.079 --> 27:20.359
but also ask me to help grill it.

27:21.279 --> 27:22.664
That's quite a move.

27:23.680 --> 27:25.920
Let everyone's talents shine
and make the most of everything.

27:26.519 --> 27:28.039
Your right hand should do something, too.

27:28.039 --> 27:29.119
Come over

27:29.119 --> 27:30.519
and fan me later.

27:30.519 --> 27:32.440
If I fan for you, how can I roast?

27:37.000 --> 27:38.240
Mr. Jiang,

27:38.240 --> 27:39.720
how about

27:39.720 --> 27:41.039
I perform a trick

27:41.039 --> 27:42.519
for you?

27:43.759 --> 27:44.880
How about

27:46.680 --> 27:47.960
I show you how to breathe fire?

27:47.960 --> 27:49.680
You see.

27:49.680 --> 27:51.480
Hold on.

27:51.480 --> 27:52.759
I've brought you something to eat.

28:03.480 --> 28:04.960
It's the top-grade tribute white honey.

28:04.960 --> 28:06.759
It's good for relieving pain
and boosting energy. I'm considerate, right?

28:08.119 --> 28:09.960
Bring it here.

28:11.039 --> 28:12.039
Back then in Luoyang,

28:12.039 --> 28:13.519
the baked cakes you sent me

28:13.519 --> 28:14.920
also had a layer of honey brushed on it.

28:18.720 --> 28:19.799
This is my family's

28:19.799 --> 28:21.400
exclusive roasting method.

28:21.400 --> 28:22.759
I don't usually pass it on to outsiders.

28:24.000 --> 28:26.400
You're in for a treat today.

28:57.680 --> 28:58.984
Have a taste.

29:08.039 --> 29:09.160
Sweet and crispy.

29:09.160 --> 29:10.640
It's really nice.

29:10.640 --> 29:12.168
Break a piece for me.

29:19.000 --> 29:20.079
No wonder it's called tribute honey.

29:20.680 --> 29:21.680
It's incredibly sweet.

29:23.799 --> 29:25.079
Are you getting addicted to bossing me around?

29:25.880 --> 29:27.272
Break it yourself.

29:27.920 --> 29:29.448
Be careful. It's hot.

29:31.279 --> 29:33.119
I'm grilling meat for you,

29:33.119 --> 29:34.960
and you break the sesame cakes for me.

29:34.960 --> 29:36.920
It's just a matter of reciprocity.
What's wrong with that?

29:36.920 --> 29:38.519
Why haven't I eaten meat yet?

29:40.200 --> 29:41.559
It's not ready yet.

29:43.880 --> 29:45.160
There are two mouths

29:45.160 --> 29:46.319
and one hand.

29:46.920 --> 29:48.240
I can't starve myself.

29:51.839 --> 29:53.480
You should wipe the honey
from your mouth first.

30:45.640 --> 30:47.119
Who is it?

30:47.119 --> 30:48.776
Your creditor.

30:52.000 --> 30:54.759
Haven't you had enough roasted meat?

31:00.880 --> 31:02.279
They are…

31:02.279 --> 31:03.359
Thank you very much, Mr. Jiang.

31:03.359 --> 31:05.720
Tomorrow, I will send the money to you.

31:09.119 --> 31:10.359
I'll help you move them in.

31:11.440 --> 31:12.872
Thank you.

31:17.920 --> 31:19.000
But there's no need

31:19.000 --> 31:20.640
to rush with sending flowers.

31:20.640 --> 31:22.559
Why go through the trouble
in the middle of the night?

31:23.440 --> 31:25.160
Considering the effort
you've put into grilling meat.

31:25.680 --> 31:27.279
I give you a return gift.

31:27.279 --> 31:28.559
Doctor Fu of Imperial Medical Bureau

31:28.559 --> 31:30.039
personally made this ointment.

31:30.039 --> 31:31.400
It's specifically for treating
damaged tendons and veins.

31:33.640 --> 31:34.880
Can you be that kind?

31:36.000 --> 31:37.319
It's worth 1,000 wen.

31:39.039 --> 31:41.359
I can't afford it. You keep it for your own.

31:41.359 --> 31:42.480
No need for you to pay me.

31:43.359 --> 31:44.359
I'm counting on your hands

31:44.359 --> 31:46.160
to make money for me and grill meat.

31:46.839 --> 31:48.839
If you don't get better soon,
I'll be the one at a loss.

31:59.720 --> 32:01.240
I'll just do it myself.

32:02.359 --> 32:04.559
Do you know the special way

32:04.559 --> 32:05.864
to apply this medicine?

32:33.736 --> 32:36.232
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

32:36.232 --> 32:39.371
♫ Congealing so much of the past ♫

32:40.104 --> 32:42.056
♫ It sinks into your gaze ♫

32:42.600 --> 32:45.854
♫ Melting and flowing with you ♫

32:46.440 --> 32:48.328
♫ If love is like frost ♫

32:51.200 --> 32:52.648
Bear with it.

32:53.160 --> 32:54.568
♫ Can it ♫

32:56.799 --> 32:58.344
Jiang Changyang,

32:58.880 --> 33:00.440
you're a decent guy

33:01.400 --> 33:03.160
when you're not talking.

33:03.160 --> 33:07.396
♫ Clouds are hidden by night ♫

33:09.480 --> 33:11.039
I'll be gentle.

33:11.039 --> 33:14.344
♫ Seeking a place to rest ♫

33:15.976 --> 33:22.152
♫ The moon falls on my shoulder,
a path of dim yellow ♫

33:22.152 --> 33:27.368
♫ Silk grows, sprouting longing ♫

33:27.368 --> 33:29.967
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

33:29.967 --> 33:33.672
♫ What's the harm in a life of solitude ♫

33:33.672 --> 33:36.101
♫ Yet you shine as light ♫

33:36.101 --> 33:40.144
♫ Piercing through my heart ♫

33:40.144 --> 33:42.404
♫ If love is like frost ♫

33:42.404 --> 33:47.016
♫ There's a flickering candle ♫

33:47.016 --> 33:48.424
♫ No words are said ♫

33:48.424 --> 33:50.760
♫ Yet for you ♫

33:50.760 --> 33:53.992
♫ I'll go ahead ♫

33:53.992 --> 33:55.615
♫ As I cast a glance back ♫

33:55.615 --> 34:03.208
♫ I behold mountains tall and rivers' track ♫

34:11.320 --> 34:12.760
[Jiang Mansion]
Please.

34:12.760 --> 34:14.440
Let me see Floral Envoy.

34:14.440 --> 34:15.920
Who is this lady?

34:16.440 --> 34:18.039
How dare she make a racket
in front of Jiang Mansion?

34:18.800 --> 34:20.320
To ask Floral Envoy for help?

34:20.320 --> 34:21.320
He's not that kind.

34:21.320 --> 34:23.599
Please.

34:23.599 --> 34:26.920
Please let me see Floral Envoy.

34:27.719 --> 34:29.480
Please.

34:29.480 --> 34:32.800
Please let me see Floral Envoy.

34:33.400 --> 34:34.440
Mother.

34:34.440 --> 34:36.199
- Fan'er.
- I'm in pain.

34:37.519 --> 34:39.159
I want to go home.

34:40.199 --> 34:42.599
Good boy, Fan'er.

34:42.599 --> 34:44.000
Your elder brother will save you.

34:46.039 --> 34:47.719
Please.

34:47.719 --> 34:50.280
Please let me see Floral Envoy.

34:52.599 --> 34:53.719
Jiang Changyang,

34:54.599 --> 34:56.320
he is your younger brother.

34:56.320 --> 34:58.119
He is also your only kin.

34:58.800 --> 35:01.360
Are you just going to watch him suffer

35:01.360 --> 35:03.199
and not say anything?

35:03.199 --> 35:04.239
Mother.

35:04.239 --> 35:06.360
- You can't go in.
- Let's go home.

35:06.360 --> 35:08.719
I'm fine.

35:14.079 --> 35:15.159
You hate me.

35:15.159 --> 35:16.800
You can kill me.

35:17.400 --> 35:19.599
But how can you just stand by

35:19.599 --> 35:21.599
and do nothing for your own kin?

35:21.599 --> 35:22.639
I beg you to save him.

35:23.159 --> 35:25.039
I beg you to save him.

35:25.960 --> 35:27.599
I beg you to save him.

35:28.280 --> 35:31.800
I beg you to save him.

35:31.800 --> 35:33.679
Please save him.

35:34.599 --> 35:36.119
Please save him.

35:36.719 --> 35:38.239
Please save him.

35:38.239 --> 35:39.559
Are you alright?

35:39.559 --> 35:40.760
Jiang Changyang,

35:40.760 --> 35:42.519
please save him.

35:43.079 --> 35:46.880
Please save him.

35:47.440 --> 35:49.159
I beg you to save him.

35:50.840 --> 35:53.039
Jiang Changyang,
please save your younger brother.

35:53.039 --> 35:54.559
Lady He, just don't go.

35:54.559 --> 35:56.400
No one's persuasion will work.

35:56.400 --> 35:58.679
She is the concubine of My lord's father.

35:58.679 --> 36:00.800
My lord will definitely not care about her.

36:08.296 --> 36:09.519
I know.

36:09.519 --> 36:10.920
Jiang Changyang,

36:10.920 --> 36:12.559
come out and take a look.

36:22.239 --> 36:23.679
The clear sound of the zither

36:23.679 --> 36:25.559
can't cover the cries outside.

36:27.519 --> 36:29.920
If you find them annoying,

36:29.920 --> 36:30.960
just have someone

36:30.960 --> 36:32.239
get rid of them.

36:32.840 --> 36:34.760
Let Chuanyu give them some money and fabric,

36:34.760 --> 36:36.079
and send them off to the infirmary.

36:39.880 --> 36:41.239
Who are they?

36:41.239 --> 36:42.239
Why bother?

36:44.079 --> 36:45.159
Who are you

36:46.280 --> 36:47.920
to meddle in my affairs?

36:50.079 --> 36:52.800
I'm not in your business.

36:52.800 --> 36:54.679
Just now at the entrance,

36:54.679 --> 36:56.000
I saw that little kid.

36:56.000 --> 36:57.960
He was in unbearable pain all over,

36:57.960 --> 36:59.079
spitting up blood.

36:59.800 --> 37:01.320
But he kept holding

37:01.320 --> 37:03.119
onto this grasshopper tightly,

37:03.719 --> 37:05.128
never letting go.

37:06.360 --> 37:08.079
This is still in your mansion.

37:08.079 --> 37:10.000
I thought

37:10.000 --> 37:12.039
I should let you know

37:12.039 --> 37:13.159
in case

37:15.400 --> 37:16.599
there's some hidden story behind it.

37:22.639 --> 37:23.800
There's no hidden story.

37:25.480 --> 37:26.800
I just don't like

37:26.800 --> 37:27.920
the mother and son.

37:29.840 --> 37:31.719
If it were merely because Mrs. Bai

37:31.719 --> 37:34.519
took the favor that originally
belonged to Madam Jiang,

37:34.519 --> 37:36.599
you wouldn't have vented anger on that child.

37:38.039 --> 37:39.719
Although to outsiders,

37:39.719 --> 37:42.119
you are seen as an unforgivable sycophant,

37:42.719 --> 37:44.079
I've known you for quite some time.

37:44.679 --> 37:46.184
I know very well

37:47.360 --> 37:48.880
that you are not like that.

38:00.039 --> 38:01.576
You think

38:02.599 --> 38:03.800
I should save him.

38:08.920 --> 38:10.519
I can't judge this.

38:11.199 --> 38:12.400
But I think

38:14.519 --> 38:15.599
you want to save him.

38:16.880 --> 38:19.239
You think I'm too merciful.

38:23.320 --> 38:25.480
Do you know why that child is frail and sickly?

38:26.920 --> 38:28.039
When she was about to give birth,

38:28.039 --> 38:30.000
Mrs. Bai had a difficult labor
and almost lost her life.

38:31.280 --> 38:32.960
Her screams were extremely agonizing

38:32.960 --> 38:34.679
far surpassing those of today.

38:35.840 --> 38:37.128
Wonder

38:37.639 --> 38:39.239
how I know this?

38:41.119 --> 38:42.360
Because I was just outside

38:42.360 --> 38:43.800
their main gate.

38:47.280 --> 38:48.960
Her child didn't deserve to die.

38:50.400 --> 38:52.519
But what about my mother?

39:09.679 --> 39:12.079
Fan'er.

39:12.079 --> 39:13.280
Mudan,

39:13.280 --> 39:14.280
will we offend Floral Envoy

39:14.280 --> 39:15.960
by doing this?

39:18.559 --> 39:20.440
He didn't say others couldn't save him.

39:21.480 --> 39:24.280
I thought he was a good man,

39:24.280 --> 39:26.920
but I didn't think
he'd be so cruel to his brother.

39:27.519 --> 39:29.159
Don't jump to conclusions lightly.

39:29.159 --> 39:30.559
This is his family affair.

39:30.559 --> 39:32.679
We can't understand the grudges involved.

39:43.280 --> 39:44.584
How's the boy?

39:46.039 --> 39:47.159
I've just applied acupuncture,

39:47.159 --> 39:48.360
and the child has fallen asleep.

39:49.920 --> 39:52.159
His illness is quite bizarre.

39:52.159 --> 39:53.480
He suffers from limb pain and weakness,

39:53.480 --> 39:55.639
with the left lower limb swollen
and sensitive to touch.

39:55.639 --> 39:57.440
I initially suspected it might be a tumor,

39:57.440 --> 39:59.239
but there's no redness

39:59.239 --> 40:00.239
or ulceration on the skin.

40:01.840 --> 40:02.840
In my opinion,

40:03.400 --> 40:04.840
it seems like he might have
ghostly bone disease.

40:05.360 --> 40:07.239
What disease is this?

40:07.239 --> 40:08.920
I've never heard of it.

40:08.920 --> 40:11.079
The disease causes the bones to wither
and the marrow to diminish.

40:11.079 --> 40:12.119
When it strikes,

40:12.119 --> 40:14.360
the patient feels as if millions of insects
are gnawing at his body,

40:14.360 --> 40:15.944
causing unbearable pain.

40:17.400 --> 40:19.320
Is there any hope for recovery?

40:19.320 --> 40:21.039
Although the disease is not fatal,

40:21.039 --> 40:23.280
it is extremely difficult to cure completely.

40:24.360 --> 40:25.760
With my current medical skills,

40:25.760 --> 40:27.039
I can only provide temporary relief.

40:27.760 --> 40:30.239
But I've read a book by Master Doctor Fu
of Imperial Medical Bureau.

40:30.239 --> 40:32.159
The book mentions this disease.

40:32.880 --> 40:34.480
To truly cure this,

40:34.480 --> 40:36.280
it seems only he has the capability.

40:41.519 --> 40:43.360
It seems we have to rely on Jiang Changyang.

40:44.920 --> 40:46.519
My lord is truly not in the mansion.

40:46.519 --> 40:48.360
Lady He, don't bother searching for him.

41:22.559 --> 41:23.976
Come in.

41:29.360 --> 41:30.480
Have something to eat.

41:34.920 --> 41:36.559
Is there still no news of Mr. Jiang?

42:09.253 --> 42:15.527
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

42:17.381 --> 42:24.065
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

42:24.741 --> 42:31.939
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

42:32.933 --> 42:41.285
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

42:41.285 --> 42:48.828
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

42:49.482 --> 42:57.669
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

42:57.669 --> 43:05.480
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

43:06.085 --> 43:13.377
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

43:34.053 --> 43:40.936
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

43:42.237 --> 43:48.931
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

43:49.688 --> 43:56.990
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

43:57.674 --> 44:05.983
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

44:05.983 --> 44:13.414
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

44:14.245 --> 44:22.501
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

44:22.501 --> 44:29.925
♫ If the heart is like water,
